 planet. But we're not allowed to mention them.\n\nI understand that NYC has the largest j population outside of the home country. They are an extremely powerful lobby there. Why on earth would they allow a muslim to take over NYC??\n\nAnswer: Because that group thinks they can use the muslims to get rid of a free country, too, and then impose their own laws on it.\n\nCommunists. Muslims. That third party.\n\nNot one of them is a product of Western civilization. \n\nWestern Civ was created through the elegant combination of classical Greek philosophy with Christianity.\n\nThose three parties listed above have absolutely zero to do with any of that. They want it GONE because it interferes with each of them imposing their own way on the world.\n\nSo we have this unholy triumvirate, forged in the lowest level of Hell, where they each think they're going to use the others to destroy what remains of the West and take it over for themselves.\n\nThey are also holding terrible threats over every person in the West: water supplies and power supplies taken down, and massive wildfires started in the hills above the cities, just for a start.\n\nThose threats are why \"nothing ever happens.\"\n\nGod help us all.\n\n", "author": "Cuetardian", "created": 1787155141227, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "GhostOfTheRepublic", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "The West is dealing with an unholy triumvirate, forged in the lowest level of Hell, where they each think they're going to use the others to destroy what remains of the West and take it for themselves. Change my mind.", "last_comment_created": 1787155332580, "content": "<p>From another post earlier today.</p>\n<p>&quot;Commies want to destroy the U.S. Constitution because they think they can bring about a Communist utopia.</p>\n<p>&quot;Mohammadans wants to destroy the U.S. Constitution and replace it with Sharia law.&quot;</p>\n<p>I completely agree.</p>\n<p>I believe each side thinks it's using the other to take down the U.S. Constitution. And each one is so arrogant that they honestly think they can do it.</p>\n<p>There may be a third side in there, too, that also wants its own rules and tradition to be the iron-clad law of the land on the entire planet. But we're not allowed to mention them.</p>\n<p>I understand that NYC has the largest j population outside of the home country. They are an extremely powerful lobby there. Why on earth would they allow a muslim to take over NYC??</p>\n<p>Answer: Because that group thinks they can use the muslims to get rid of a free country, too, and then impose their own laws on it.</p>\n<p>Communists. Muslims. That third party.</p>\n<p>Not one of them is a product of Western civilization.</p>\n<p>Western Civ was created through the elegant combination of classical Greek philosophy with Christianity.</p>\n<p>Those three parties listed above have absolutely zero to do with any of that. They want it GONE because it interferes with each of them imposing their own way on the world.</p>\n<p>So we have this unholy triumvirate, forged in the lowest level of Hell, where they each think they're going to use the others to destroy what remains of the West and take it over for themselves.</p>\n<p>They are also holding terrible threats over every person in the West: water supplies and power supplies taken down, and massive wildfires started in the hills above the cities, just for a start.</p>\n<p>Those threats are why &quot;nothing ever happens.&quot;</p>\n<p>God help us all.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 11, "is_edited": false, "is_m